  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "およそ４００ねんまえに　たんこうで\nみつかった。　からだの　ほとんどが\nせきたんと　おなじ　せいぶん。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "약 400년 전에 탄광에서\n발견되었다. 몸의 대부분이\n석탄과 같은 성분이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "大約４００年前在煤礦坑中\n被人們發現。身體絕大部分\n的成分都和煤炭相同。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "On l’a découvert dans une mine il y a 400 ans.\nSon corps est presque entièrement composé\nd’une substance identique au charbon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es wurde vor circa 400 Jahren in einer Kohlemine\nentdeckt. Sein Körper besteht fast aus denselben\nKomponenten wie Steinkohle.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Fue descubierto hace aproximadamente 400\naños en una mina. Casi la totalidad de su cuerpo\npresenta una composición igual a la del carbón.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È stato scoperto più di 400 anni fa in una\nminiera. Il suo corpo è prevalentemente\ncomposto di una sostanza uguale al carbone.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Most of its body has the same composition as\ncoal. Fittingly, this Pokémon was first discovered\nin coal mines about 400 years ago.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "およそ４００年前に　炭鉱で\n見つかった。　体の　ほとんどが\n石炭と　同じ　成分。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "大约４００年前在煤矿坑中\n被人们发现。身体绝大部分\n的成分都和煤炭相同。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Fue descubierto hace aproximadamente 400\naños en una mina. Casi la totalidad de su cuerpo\npresenta una composición igual a la del carbón.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "いわだらけの　あくろを　ものともせず\nいちりんしゃのように　はしりまわる。\nせきたんを　もやして　いきている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "바위투성이의 거친 길을 아무렇지도\n않게 일륜차처럼 달린다.\n석탄을 태워서 살고 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在滿是岩石的崎嶇路面上\n也能像獨輪車那樣自在移動。\n靠燃燒煤炭維持生命。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il parcourt sans difficulté les sentiers rocheux\naccidentés à la manière d’un monocycle.\nIl a besoin de brûler du charbon pour vivre.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Auch auf steinigen, schlecht befahrbaren Wegen\nfährt es problemlos, als wäre es ein Einrad.\nEs verbrennt Steinkohle, um zu überleben.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Recorre incluso los caminos más impracticables y\npedregosos como si de un monociclo se tratase.\nLa combustión de carbón es su fuente vital.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Corre in lungo e in largo come un monociclo\nanche sulle strade sassose più accidentate.\nVive grazie alla combustione del carbone.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It can race around like a unicycle, even on rough,\nrocky terrain. Burning coal sustains it.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "岩だらけの　悪路を　ものともせず\n一輪車のように　走りまわる。\n石炭を　燃やして　生きている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在满是岩石的崎岖之路上\n也能像独轮车那样自在移动。\n靠燃烧煤炭维持生命。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Recorre incluso los caminos más impracticables y\npedregosos como si de un monociclo se tratase.\nLa combustión de carbón es su fuente vital.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "はれた　ひは　そうげんに　でてきてはしりまわり　しゃりんのような　あしにまきこんだ　くさを　たべる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "맑은 날에는 초원으로 나와 달리면서 수레바퀴 같은 다리에 휘감긴 풀을 먹는다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "晴天時會到草原東奔西跑，然後吃掉被牠那長得像是車輪的腳捲進去的草。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quand il fait beau, ce Pokémon sort se promener dans les hautes herbes. Il mange ensuite les brins emmêlés dans sa roue.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "An sonnigen Tagen rollt es gerne auf Wiesen herum und frisst dabei das Gras, das sich in seinem radähnlichen Bein verfangen hat.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "En días despejados, sale a corretear por los prados y se come las hierbas que se le queden enredadas en su pata con forma de rueda.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nei giorni di sole esce all’aperto a scorrazzare per i prati e mangia l’erba che rimane attaccata alla zampa, che sembra una ruota.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "On sunny days, Rolycoly will come out onto grassy plains and roll around. Then it will eat the grass that gets tangled in its wheel-like leg.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "晴れた　日は　草原に　出てきて走りまわり　車輪のような　脚に巻きこんだ　草を　食べる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "晴天时会在草原东奔西跑，然后吃掉被卷进它那仿佛是车轮的脚里的草。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "En días despejados, sale a corretear por los prados y se come las hierbas que se le queden enredadas en su pata con forma de rueda.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ふるくなり　はがれおちた　からだの　ひょうめんはせきたんの　かわりにねんりょうとして　つかわれてきた。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "오래되어 떨어진 몸의 표면은 석탄을 대신하는 연료로 사용되어 왔다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "脫落的老舊體表一直以來都當成燃料來代替煤炭使用。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Au fil du temps, de petits morceaux de ce Pokémon se détachent. On s’en sert comme combustible à la place du charbon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Bruchstücke der Oberfläche dieses Pokémon, die altersbedingt herabfallen, werden seit jeher als Brennstoffersatz für Steinkohle verwendet.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Las partes envejecidas de la corteza que se le desprenden se utilizan como combustible en lugar del carbón.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Con il tempo, alcuni pezzi sulla superficie del suo corpo si staccano e cadono a terra. Vengono usati come combustibile al posto del carbone.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Chunks of the surface of this Pokémon’s body that have grown old and flaked off have long been used for fuel as an alternative to coal.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "古くなり　剥がれ落ちた　体の　表面は石炭の　代わりに燃料として　使われてきた。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
